WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.422 --> 00:00:15.584
didn't know Guanyin was really Red Boy in disguise.

2
00:00:15.604 --> 00:00:20.687
"The Tang Monk is in trouble," said the pig to the fake Guanyin.

3
00:00:21.827 --> 00:00:24.109
demon named Red Boy is planning to eat him.

4
00:00:25.469 --> 00:00:26.150
Can you help us?"

5
00:00:27.771 --> 00:00:30.916
course," said the fake Guanyin.

6
00:00:30.936 --> 00:00:31.917
"I know Red Boy.

7
00:00:32.718 --> 00:00:33.418
very nice.

8
00:00:34.519 --> 00:00:37.121
I doubt he'll harm the Tang Monk.

9
00:00:39.103 --> 00:00:41.525
Let's go to Red Boy's cave and talk to him."

10
00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:51.112
and the fake Guanyin flew to Red Boy's cave.

11
00:00:53.935 --> 00:00:59.160
Bajie went in first.

12
00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:03.661
Red Boy returned to his normal appearance and then sneaked up behind Bajie.

13
00:01:05.622 --> 00:01:07.462
He threw a sack over the pig.

14
00:01:08.343 --> 00:01:09.743
"Hey, what's going on?"

15
00:01:10.023 --> 00:01:10.863
shouted Bajie.

16
00:01:12.424 --> 00:01:14.044
not Guanyin, you fool!"

17
00:01:15.325 --> 00:01:17.125
The demon laughed.

18
00:01:17.505 --> 00:01:18.305
Red Boy!

19
00:01:18.785 --> 00:01:20.326
And now you're trapped!"

20
00:01:25.407 --> 00:01:27.588
The demon locked Bajie in a room.

21
00:01:31.084 --> 00:01:32.705
"Why isn't Bajie back yet?"

22
00:01:33.005 --> 00:01:33.805
asked Wujing.

23
00:01:35.325 --> 00:01:38.606
frowned. "He probably stopped to take a nap.

24
00:01:39.146 --> 00:01:40.987
That pig is so lazy."

25
00:01:42.467 --> 00:01:44.828
nodded. "Yes, he's very lazy.

26
00:01:45.268 --> 00:01:46.169
What should we do now?"

27
00:01:47.949 --> 00:01:50.930
"I'm going to sneak into Red Boy's cave," said Wukong.

28
00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:55.051
"I want to make sure the Tang Monk is still alive.

29
00:01:56.031 --> 00:01:57.712
Then I'll go to Guanyin myself."

30
00:01:58.752 --> 00:02:02.315
The monkey turned himself into a bee and flew up the mountain.

31
00:02:05.517 --> 00:02:09.580
He slipped through the cave door and flew down a long tunnel.

32
00:02:10.741 --> 00:02:12.902
Soon he heard the Tang Monk crying.

33
00:02:12.922 --> 00:02:17.586
"Master is scared," thought Wukong.

34
00:02:19.147 --> 00:02:20.408
at least he's still alive."

35
00:02:21.268 --> 00:02:23.370
The monkey then heard a shout.

36
00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:24.491
It was Bajie.

37
00:02:24.511 --> 00:02:26.072
"You filthy demon!

38
00:02:26.784 --> 00:02:29.686
How dare you make yourself look like Guanyin and fool me!"

39
00:02:29.706 --> 00:02:32.468
"Aha!" thought Wukong.

40
00:02:32.488 --> 00:02:34.990
"Bajie didn't take a nap after all.

41
00:02:35.811 --> 00:02:37.852
I must go to the real Guanyin right away."

42
00:02:39.814 --> 00:02:43.997
The monkey flew out of the cave and told Wujing what he'd just learned.

43
00:02:45.518 --> 00:02:48.220
Then he jumped onto a cloud and headed south.

44
00:02:50.962 --> 00:02:53.144
He found Guanyin in her pagoda.

45
00:02:58.344 --> 00:03:00.266
"Wukong, why are you here?"

46
00:03:00.546 --> 00:03:01.367
asked Guanyin.

47
00:03:01.387 --> 00:03:05.310
"We have a problem, Bodhisattva," said the monkey.

48
00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:08.813
"The Tang Monk was caught by a demon named Red Boy.

49
00:03:10.194 --> 00:03:13.157
The demon makes magic fire that water can't put out.

50
00:03:14.518 --> 00:03:16.680
Bajie was on his way here to ask for your help.

51
00:03:18.321 --> 00:03:21.244
But the demon made himself look like you and tricked the pig."

52
00:03:22.205 --> 00:03:24.567
Guanyin's face burned with anger.

53
00:03:24.587 --> 00:03:29.069
"How dare that demon make himself look like me!"

54
00:03:30.069 --> 00:03:33.470
The bodhisattva grabbed a vase and stormed outside.

55
00:03:38.611 --> 00:03:43.192
She threw the vase down into the ocean, where it sank beneath the waves.

56
00:03:45.553 --> 00:03:46.593
Wukong gasped.

57
00:03:46.833 --> 00:03:49.534
"That vase was a Buddhist treasure!

58
00:03:49.554 --> 00:03:51.495
Why did you throw it away?"

59
00:03:53.095 --> 00:03:53.755
didn't answer.

60
00:03:54.435 --> 00:03:57.956
A minute later the water rumbled.

61
00:03:58.157 --> 00:03:58.717
vase reappeared.

62
00:03:59.718 --> 00:04:02.280
It was atop the shell of a giant turtle.

63
00:04:06.183 --> 00:04:09.025
The turtle came onto the shore and bowed its head.

64
00:04:09.045 --> 00:04:13.689
"Go down and get the vase, Wukong," said Guanyin.

65
00:04:16.131 --> 00:04:19.594
The monkey ran down the mountain and tried to pick up the vase.

66
00:04:24.518 --> 00:04:27.280
Wukong grunted and used all of his strength.

67
00:04:29.164 --> 00:04:33.367
But no matter how hard he tried, he couldn't lift the vase at all.

68
00:04:33.387 --> 00:04:36.629
"Bodhisattva!" he called.

69
00:04:36.649 --> 00:04:38.270
"I don't understand.

70
00:04:39.371 --> 00:04:41.833
It's just a small vase, but I can't lift it!"

71
00:04:45.355 --> 00:04:47.116
Guanyin came down the mountain.

72
00:04:47.136 --> 00:04:53.220
"That vase just traveled around the world, through all the oceans and rivers.

73
00:04:54.481 --> 00:04:58.444
It now holds an ocean's worth of water—magic water.

74
00:05:00.168 --> 00:05:02.529
The water will put out Red Boy's fire."

75
00:05:06.871 --> 00:05:09.372
Guanyin picked up the vase with one hand.

76
00:05:11.213 --> 00:05:14.914
She held up her other hand, and several swords appeared.

77
00:05:16.655 --> 00:05:20.557
She waved them, and they turned into a large lotus platform.

78
00:05:24.538 --> 00:05:26.799
have what I need now," said Guanyin.

79
00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:28.120
"Let's go."
